p to change a wheel and Chevallier came in as well to cure a plug trouble.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":2,"text":"Fourny takes the lead from Czaykowski; Etancelin moves up to third.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":3,"text":"Etancelin moves up to second.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":5,"text":"Etancelin takes the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":5,"text":"Etancelin put in a 4m03s lap followed by a 4m01s one, pulling away from the rest.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":6,"text":"After six laps Fourny was seven seconds behind Etancelin and was challenged by Lehoux","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":7,"text":"Lehoux laps in 3m54s and passes Fourny for second.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":7,"text":"Tetaldi crashed and Wersant retired as well.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":8,"text":"In the smaller class Scaron was leading with his Amilcar while Auber in second position overdid it, crashed through a fence, and had to retire.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":9,"text":"Lehoux, suffering from a sprained wrist, hands his Bugatti to Jacquin; Wimille hands over to Gaupillat.","q":false},{"lap":10,"text":"Etancelin made the first ten laps in almost exactly 40 minutes (122.316 km/h)","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":16,"text":"The weather turned worse and it started to rain again.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":18,"text":"On the 18th lap Jacquin crashed and turned over Lehoux's Bugatti but the driver survived without any serious injuries.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":20,"text":"After 20 laps Etancelin was leading Fourny by 1m28s. Gaupillat had passed Czaykowski for third position. After signals from the pit Etancelin was easing up and concentrated only on keeping up the current gap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":21,"text":"On the 21th lap Scaron stopped his Amilcar with mechanical trouble and started walking back to the pit and Howe, who had been advancing through the field after his first lap stop, took over the lead in the voiturette class.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":26,"text":"Fourny was falling back a bit and Gaupillat took over second position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":35,"text":"On the 35th lap Wimille took back the car from Gaupillat.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":36,"text":"But on the very first lap after his return Wimille crashed at Saint Aubin. He escaped without a scratch but the Bugatti caught fire.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":36,"text":"The car was sitting at the middle of the road in a blind corner and Fourny came into the curve at some 115 km/h and crashed straight into Wimille's car. Fourny's T35C overturned and threw the driver out.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":37,"text":"The rain turned worse. In the same corner as the former crash Mary had an incident as well and had to retire.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":37,"text":"With both Wimille and Fourny out of the race Etancelin had lost his main competition and he now led by 3m50s over Czaykowski, who due to the accidents of the others had moved back to second position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":39,"text":"Etancelin then made a 1m40s pit stop with refueling but still led Czaykowski, who had not made his pit stop yet, by over 2 minutes.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":46,"text":"Czaykowski was doing his best to catch the leader and managed to close down the gap to 1m45s. He then made a 1m07s stop for refueling and continued the chase","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":52,"text":"After 52 laps his lead over Czaykowski was 3m17s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":58,"text":"It was still raining but Etancelin did not have to take any chances but could take it easy the last laps until the clock reached 5:45 p.m. and the chequered flag dropped.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":58,"text":"Czaykowski finished second some 2 \u00bd minutes behind and Earl Howe, just a lap behind after an excellent drive, was a surprise third in the Delage and winner of the voiturette class by a huge eight lap margin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1}]}